meta {
  name: Upload Monev Documents
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{host}}/api/admin/monev/:id/upload
  body: multipartForm
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: your-monev-uuid-here
}

body:multipart-form {
  berita_acara: @file(C:\path\to\berita-acara.pdf)
  form_penilaian: @file(C:\path\to\form-penilaian.pdf)
}

docs {
  # POST /api/admin/monev/:id/upload
  
  Upload dokumen Berita Acara dan/atau Form Penilaian untuk Monev.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Description |
  |-----------|------|-------------|
  | id | UUID | ID monev tujuan upload |
  
  ## Request Body (multipart/form-data)
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | berita_acara | File | No | PDF Berita Acara Monev |
  | form_penilaian | File | No | PDF Form Penilaian |
  
  ## File Constraints
  - **Format**: PDF only (.pdf)
  - **Max size**: 10MB per file
  - **Min one file**: Minimal satu file harus diupload
  
  ## Response Success (200)
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Dokumen monev berhasil diupload",
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "berita_acara": "/uploads/monev/berita-acara-1704700800000.pdf",
      "form_penilaian": "/uploads/monev/form-penilaian-1704700800000.pdf",
      "status_dokumen": "Lengkap",
      "updatedAt": "2025-01-08T00:00:00.000Z"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Response Error (400)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "Minimal satu file harus diupload"
  }
  ```
  
  ## Response Error (400 - Invalid Format)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "File harus berformat PDF"
  }
  ```
  
  ## Notes
  - Upload akan menimpa file sebelumnya jika sudah ada
  - Status dokumen otomatis berubah ke "Lengkap" jika kedua file sudah diupload
  - Status dokumen berubah ke "Sedang Diproses" jika hanya satu file yang diupload
}
